&lt;li&gt;Experience in state estimation, e.g. Kalman filter, extended Kalman filter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Matlab and Simulink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to work on GNC solutions that have real-world impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in digital control systems, linear and nonlinear dynamics systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in state estimation, e.g. Kalman filter, extended Kalman filter&lt;/li&gt;
