&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to value/procurement engineering or TCO-related work at the component &amp;amp; product level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with developing high-tech products in a high-mix, low-volume environment&lt;/li&gt;
