&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfortable with scripting languages (e.g., Python) for test automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Interest in defense technology and mission-driven work&lt;/li&gt;
