&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The Lethality team designs, builds, tests, and fields mechanical warhead and ordnance systems that integrate directly with Anduril platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our engineers work across mechanical design, manufacturing, analysis, testing, safety, and vehicle integration to move new concepts from an idea to tested hardware quickly. The team is highly hands-on and built for engineers who want to design new products, solve difficult problems, and see their decisions become real hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The Lethality Team is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help develop the next generation of warhead and ordnance systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will design new mechanical hardware, work directly with the people building it, test your designs, and use the results to make the next iteration better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yes, you may actually get paid to blow things up.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You do &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; need to arrive as a warhead expert. We are looking for strong mechanical engineers with practical design experience, sound engineering judgment, curiosity, and the ability to learn a highly specialized domain quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design new mechanical hardware from requirements and early concepts through detailed CAD, drawings, fabrication, assembly, and test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn engineering ideas into manufacturable products by making practical decisions around materials, tolerances, interfaces, manufacturing methods, cost, and assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test, and improve your designs by working directly with manufacturing, technicians, analysis, and test teams to identify problems and drive the next iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate your hardware into larger systems by partnering with vehicle, systems, safety, and other engineering teams to resolve interfaces and technical tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your technical ownership by progressing from defined components and workstreams toward increasingly independent subsystem design and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPACT YOU&#39;LL HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver new lethality hardware that directly supports U.S. and allied warfighters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take products from early concepts to physical hardware instead of maintaining legacy designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop specialized expertise in warhead and ordnance engineering alongside experienced technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See the direct impact of your engineering decisions through manufacturing, integration, and live testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Aerospace Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, or a related discipline, or equivalent combination of education and work experience..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional mechanical design experience taking physical hardware from initial concept through fabrication and functional test..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in parametric 3D CAD (NX, SolidWorks, or Creo) and modern PLM/PDM environments (e.g., Teamcenter)..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of engineering drawings and practical application of ASME Y14.5 GD&amp;amp;T and tolerance stack-up analysis..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on prototyping and fabrication experience, including root-cause analysis of manufacturing and hardware defects..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coursework or professional experience applying statics, dynamics, material selection, heat transfer, and structural mechanics to hardware design problems..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Security Clearance..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you will be subject to pre-employment and randomized substance screening, as required by the Company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or PhD in Mechanical Engineering, Aerospace Engineering, or a related field..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in defense, aerospace, or other highly regulated hardware development environments..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with FEA tools (Abaqus, ANSYS, or equivalent) for structural, thermal, or dynamic analysis..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with naval ordnance, warheads, energetic materials, DoD weapons safety boards, high-rate dynamic modeling, or live-fire arena testing..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active U.S. Security Clearance (DoD Secret, Top Secret, or DOE Q)..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some roles may require travel for field or range testing (up to 25%, primarily within Lethality work-streams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$129,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$171,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Modern threats move fast, adapt faster, and don&#39;t wait for legacy systems to catch up. The Maneuver Air Defense team&amp;nbsp;exists to close that gap — putting the tools for safety-critical decisions directly in the hands of warfighters operating on&amp;nbsp;condensed timelines in contested environments. We&#39;re building the air defense that the modern battlefield demands.&amp;nbsp;We build vehicle-based and expeditionary systems that push the boundaries of design on multiple fronts. Our approach&amp;nbsp;prioritizes ruggedized, lightweight, tightly packaged solutions that offer modularity while maintaining the&amp;nbsp;manufacturability required to scale production at low cost — without compromises to our mission.&amp;nbsp;The result is products and systems that are highly accurate, reliably self-calibrating, scalable, and attritable. They operate&amp;nbsp;autonomously to provide robust mobile fire control capabilities at the edge, effectively closing the kill chain while&amp;nbsp;contested and moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This position will own rapid development of systems and subsystems from concept to production. You will work in a&amp;nbsp;small, high-ownership team where engineers take pride in the products they deliver. The ideal candidate has an interest in&amp;nbsp;rapid-prototyping and iterative design as well as high growth mindset and a strong attention to detail. The engineering&amp;nbsp;opportunities at hand are demanding — individuals joining this team must have a high capacity to work cross-functionally&amp;nbsp;and be invigorated by solving challenges on tight timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Own and drive the mechanical design of ruggedized, vehicle-based subsystems structures, and&amp;nbsp;mechanisms from concept to low rate production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply first-principles engineering and physics to every design decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Build and test prototypes of complex electromechanical systems, and iterate quickly based on the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Spearhead design reviews, conduct analysis, visit vendors, prototype and implement hardware test plans&amp;nbsp;to ensure reliability in the harshest environments on earth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Balance operational needs across vehicle subsystems while optimizing for development speed, mass,&amp;nbsp;manufacturability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work in close partnership with other disciplines to ensure the electrical, software, and mechanical systems&amp;nbsp;collectively form a reliable, flexible, cost-effective system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Cultivate a vibrant, positive, dedicated, high-energy, educational, and enjoyable community environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Support critical hardware demonstrations and field events with internal and external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Travel to test sites and vendors as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Self-starter with 3+ years of mechanical or electromechanical design experience in a professional setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Passionate about engineering and strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;BS in Mechanical Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in immersive technical projects (Formula SAE, Baja SAE, SAE Aero, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated hands-on fabrication and rapid-prototyping skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;3D CAD proficiency (any platform) and the ability to apply GD&amp;amp;T to produce high-quality engineering&amp;nbsp;drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain an active U.S. Secret security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with NX and Teamcenter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;MEng, MS, or PhD in Mechanical Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience taking ruggedized electromechanical assemblies from concept to low-rate production for&amp;nbsp;automotive, space, or military applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ability to integrate electronics into mechanical designs (motors, controllers, sensors, radars, etc.),&amp;nbsp;including packaging, thermal management, sealing, and cable harnessing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with production processes (machining, sheet metal, injection molding, welding, wire&amp;nbsp;harnessing, 3D printing) to inform design for manufacturability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with vehicle-mounted or expeditionary systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
