&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril’s Flight Engineering department is seeking Guidance, Navigation and Control (GNC) Engineers to join our team. The Anduril Flight Engineering team is integral to development of flight system solutions in all domains for our warfighters. As a critical member of our team, the role of a Guidance, Navigation, and Control (GNC) Engineer is pivotal in driving the design, development, testing, and implementation of cutting-edge flight system technologies for our aerospace systems. Anduril fosters a dynamic learning culture, characterized by accelerated knowledge acquisition through modeling, simulation, analysis, and rigorous and frequent ground and flight test experimentation. At Anduril, you will be involved in flight testing the systems you develop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking exceptional GNC Engineers&amp;nbsp;with expertise in Navigation, Sensing, or PNT to join our team. The successful candidate will play a pivotal role in&amp;nbsp;shaping the next generation of autonomous air power, advanced tactical missile systems, strategic weapons, and hypersonic strike and defense systems. As a key contributor, you will develop, test, and integrate navigation systems and architectures for subsonic, supersonic, and hypersonic autonomous systems, driving innovation in mission-critical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-WHATYOU’LLDO&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;efd9701c-743a-484c-b8fc-617718b61a11&quot;&gt;Lead navigation system design for one or more Anduril products, cradle-to-grave ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;26fb8364-567a-49b9-a2cc-72a0ddb20515&quot;&gt;Analyze and help develop mission requirements and constraints across the Anduril product portfolio to determine optimal navigation system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a105eda2-b0e8-48e4-bccd-b878df726f4e&quot;&gt;Support and drive the evaluation and integration of advanced alternative navigation aiding sources (prepare, support, and conduct lab, motion, and flight tests).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0fe06169-7ac6-4bf8-90a7-3e860cc0cf2e&quot;&gt;Support flight testing to measure &amp;amp; validate navigation performance relative to mission requirements and troubleshoot testing and operational anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c1781a7b-1d18-411e-8914-47044523d1f2&quot;&gt;Perform trade studies, modeling, simulation and other forms of analysis to validate algorithm and navigation stack accuracy, robustness, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6c3ab158-6748-4418-89b2-36738e9cb8c0&quot;&gt;Conduct simulation and testing for validation of navigation algorithms and system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2c27d11c-1c53-46e0-a291-4a3b2e1fc681&quot;&gt;Collect and analyze platform telemetry data to validate platform operation and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;547d5a5e-1252-48b8-acf1-cae8bdcf1c90&quot;&gt;Support the design, development, integration and testing of an inertial navigation systems (INS) for aerospace vehicles (UAS, spacecraft, missiles, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d90ae50b-3f0e-45f9-9492-8511121298fa&quot;&gt;Use and update Anduril&#39;s existing navigation filters, models, and simulations to improve navigation performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1ce513cb-7f53-4d50-935d-92b95f20e31d&quot;&gt;Support and drive the development of algorithms for navigation, guidance, and control systems, including Extended Kalman filters and other estimation methods using various programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3f4a82b2-36e2-412d-b05c-f98bc4e4dd4d&quot;&gt;Support and drive the development of advanced sensor fusion algorithms leveraging INS, GNSS, cameras, LiDAR, and other sensors for accurate navigation in complex environments across subsea, surface, air, and space domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c669d703-98d3-4a42-b8b5-d05c6d201e25&quot;&gt;Apply covariance analysis techniques for early requirements derivation, as well as to optimize navigation system performance, error modeling, and system uncertainty assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;f687aa3f-39ab-4d82-9112-55c5e917afe3&quot;&gt;Improve calibration procedures for sensor suites used in aerospace navigation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;15026317-7d6b-41c1-91f6-0d152a054d7c&quot;&gt;Collaborate with&amp;nbsp;GNC, Flight Software, MSA, T&amp;amp;E, product leadership, and other&amp;nbsp;multidisciplinary teams to integrate navigation software and hardware into real-world flight systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-REQUIREDQUALIFICATIONS:&quot;&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;3e514669-a12d-4158-a0aa-8c4cbd4b9cd9&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Aerospace Engineering, Electrical Engineering,&amp;nbsp;Computer Science&amp;nbsp;or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;59670475-3310-4bea-bfe4-64c7956254fd&quot;&gt;Strong bias for action, ability to thrive in uncertainty, and desire to closely collaborate cross-functionally with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;7ec95d98-0aaa-4b25-b5e9-f456ac515c49&quot;&gt;Proficiency in MATLAB &amp;amp; Simulink, C/C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;88c1b57a-08d1-4a5f-b9a3-75eaed9353c7&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of navigation principles, including inertial navigation, GPS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b21a66d6-15dc-4a32-94e2-6d34822b04ab&quot;&gt;Experience characterizing, integrating, and testing inertial and non-inertial sensing modalities like INS, GNSS, vision-based, and odometry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;679301ee-030d-49b2-bd71-a728cfe8d9fc&quot;&gt;Experience with navigation system design, development and testing on aerospace systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;250454a9-f3da-49e4-8753-09d80e2695e2&quot;&gt;Expertise in Kalman filtering, Extended Kalman filtering, and other estimation techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;49ebb596-ea8e-4cc9-97c0-bd977e99e57c&quot;&gt;Experience with real-time systems and embedded software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;51a66604-af15-4144-b0a0-10156e8ce272&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;fc9a7e18-fad1-4c45-8cdd-7f327f9e9ad2&quot;&gt;General knowledge of guidance and flight control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ef7d624f-a8d0-4835-8a4a-1250e530d227&quot;&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;optimizing and tuning navigation system performance, error modeling, and system uncertainty assessments, and requirements methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;819a6129-0349-4874-8290-6a3068d65477&quot;&gt;Must be eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Top Secret clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-Guidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)Engineer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (GNC) Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;adf389bb-c742-4f00-86aa-282cfacbd753&quot;&gt;3 or more years of experience in Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control engineering&amp;nbsp;or related technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)Engineer&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control (GNC) Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;888aeb50-469d-4f28-b3e9-0c9437564dd8&quot;&gt;8 or more years of experience in Guidance, Navigation &amp;amp; Control engineering or related technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;columnLayout single&quot; data-layout=&quot;single&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;cell normal&quot; data-type=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;innerCell&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;id-[Approved]SeniorGuidance,Navigation&amp;amp;Control(GNC)EngineerNavigationandEstimation-PREFERREDQUALIFICATIONS:&quot;&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a7db57ed-7059-4bae-bf62-5271435edf8a&quot;&gt;Autonomous air, ground or undersea vehicle navigation experience, focusing on low-cost sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;63fb98e2-2ac2-4f41-be87-283c82734f43&quot;&gt;Strong software (MATLAB, C/C++) and hardware (sensors, harnesses, PCB design) integration background, working with real-time systems is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;big&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0f961950-1bed-4688-9b60-fcfb1252aac8&quot;&gt;Experience adapting and applying real-time pose localization algorithms from robotics to enhance the accuracy and robustness of vehicle navigation where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;d2ef654b-5e5b-44fc-b41e-51cb86b1b69a&quot;&gt;Experience with 6-DOF vehicle simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b48f840e-c3c1-478e-ad61-2f2e878a0a1f&quot;&gt;GNSS receiver and antenna integration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;cec092b4-da43-461d-8565-6eb051b4aea2&quot;&gt;Current eligibility at the Top Secret level preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Per Anduril&#39;s expansion plans, we anticipate this job will be based out of Long Beach, CA beginning late 2027.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$253,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril Intelligence Systems (AIS) is focused on positioning Anduril as a lead provider of specialized engineering and products for Intelligence Community (IC) customers. We work within the IC to understand their requirements, shape their concepts of operation, and deliver exquisite capability across their problem set. We aim to develop and deploy critically needed capabilities that address our customers’ most pressing national security requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Senior Hybrid Network Engineer, you&#39;ll own a net-new, architecturally critical function: the hub-and-spoke contract between the cloud and our on-prem failover edge nodes. You&#39;ll ensure on-prem nodes mirror cloud architecture at small scale, keep operating through Degraded, Disconnected, Intermittent, and Limited (DDIL) conditions, and reconcile cleanly with the hub on reconnect - owning everything from identity federation and degraded auth to data reconciliation, config-drift automation, and DDIL reliability testing. You&#39;ll also anchor the sub-team, setting technical direction and mentoring ICs. This role requires a strong software background (Go/Rust/Python), distributed-systems fundamentals, cloud architecture depth (GCP preferred), comfort at the edge, and demonstrated ownership of a reliability/SRE or platform-engineering charter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity federation &amp;amp; degraded auth&lt;/strong&gt; - extend centralized Keycloak/LDAP identity to disconnected edge; cached-credential authentication when the hub is unreachable; propagate RBAC-by-operation/group to spokes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data reconciliation &amp;amp; state consistency&lt;/strong&gt; - own the cloud↔edge data-refresh contract: DSB migration, entity-persist service, CoTv2 bilateral consistency, un-egress republishing cache.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Config / architecture drift&lt;/strong&gt; - automate propagation of cloud-architecture changes (DSB, NCC hub-spoke, DNS) to every edge NixOS closure so spokes never silently fall out of parity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DDIL reliability mandate&lt;/strong&gt; - define and test failover/reconnect behavior against the High-Availability / DDIL ConOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical direction for the sub-team; mentor and receive the support IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently possesses and is able to maintain an active U.S. Top Secret / SCI Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software background is mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in a systems language (Go/Rust/Python), distributed-systems fundamentals (consensus, conflict resolution, eventual consistency).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud architecture depth (GCP preferred - VPC, IdP, networking) and comfort at the edge (on-prem, bare-metal deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a reliability/SRE or platform-engineering charter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$253,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril&#39;s Manufacturing Design Team is seeking a Senior Industrial Engineer to own and scale our central manufacturing layout capability and system. The Manufacturing Team is responsible for rapidly iterating and building cutting-edge defense hardware — including static equipment, moving ground equipment, sensors, undersea, and flight vehicles — and scaling these products across our production footprint, including our new 5M sq ft manufacturing facility, Arsenal-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Manufacturing, Industrial Engineering delivers layout design as an internal service: enterprise-grade production layouts that define where and how products are built — from cell and line configurations through material flow paths to full facility arrangements. Done right, layouts de-risk production ramps, eliminate waste in material handling and operator movement, maximize throughput per square foot, and give leadership a single, trusted spatial reference for every capital, capacity, and footprint decision. This role sets the standard for how that capability is architected, maintained, and consumed across the company, in close collaboration with Facilities, Real Estate, Supply Chain, Engineering, Quality, Program Management, and Business Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a &quot;draw a layout and move on&quot; role. We are looking for a senior engineer who can demonstrate holistic ownership of Anduril&#39;s factory layout capability as a durable, enterprise-wide asset — one that lives for years, absorbs changes as production systems evolve, and is trusted by leadership to make fast / efficient / standard facility, capital, and capacity decisions. The right person thrives in a fast-paced, resource-limited environment, is flexible to change and ambiguity, and can act as the connective tissue among operational stakeholders to bring a production system forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mandate is bigger than any single layout. Anduril operates across multiple sites with diverse product lines at varying maturity stages — conditions where ad-hoc layouts drawn in PowerPoint or disconnected CAD files create confusion, rework, and missed opportunities. You will decide how layouts are created, versioned, maintained, stored / “libraried”, and consumed so that &quot;where does this line go?&quot;, &quot;how much floor space do we need for rate?&quot;, and &quot;what&#39;s the material flow path?&quot; become queries against a maintained, centralized system — not one-off drawings that go stale the week they&#39;re delivered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the production floor, the preferred candidate has experience or connection to overall facility design — building shell, infrastructure integration, dock and staging areas, material flow, utility routing, and the interface between manufacturing layout and the physical plant. You will work hand-in-hand with Facilities and Real Estate to ensure that production layouts and building infrastructure are designed as an integrated system, not in isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Anduril&#39;s enterprise manufacturing layout capability as a long-lived, foundational asset — architecting it for maintainability, extensibility, and organizational adoption rather than single-use drawings. Work closely with IT and Tech Teams to integrate into existing business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design production line and workstation layouts for both low-rate and full-rate production using a data-driven approach, incorporating cell design, flow configuration, material staging, operator movement, and ergonomic considerations rooted in IE tradition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a centralized layout repository — the single source of truth for all production layouts across sites — that integrates with Facilities, Real Estate, and infrastructure planning so building shell decisions and production floor decisions are made from the same spatial model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and curate a centralized CAD shape library of standard manufacturing elements (workbenches, tables, cabinets, tool storage, chairs, racks, conveyors, carts, etc.) so that every layout across the organization uses consistent, dimensionally accurate components — reducing layout creation time and ensuring visual and spatial consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the enterprise standards for layout creation: file formats, naming conventions, layer structures, revision control, approval workflows, and the entrenched business processes that ensure layouts are created, reviewed, updated, and archived consistently across all sites and business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy those standards across the organization — selecting and implementing the tools, software, and mechanisms needed, training layout consumers and contributors, and building the governance structure that keeps the system healthy as the organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support facility-level layout planning for new buildings, expansions, and site reconfigurations — working with Facilities, Real Estate, and infrastructure partners to integrate manufacturing floor plans with building shell design, utility routing, dock placement, aisle widths, column spacing, and overhead clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify spatial bottlenecks, material flow inefficiencies, and layout constraints caused by production rate changes, new product introductions, or facility limitations; flag constraints with the appropriate owners and drive to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and maintain space utilization analyses, density metrics (units per square foot), and capacity-driven layout alternatives that tie layout decisions directly to production rate targets and business forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate layout decisions into clear visual deliverables — 2D plans, 3D renderings, block diagrams, and material flow maps — that are digestible to non-specialists so that program, operations, and leadership stakeholders can review and approve with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the migration from scattered, inconsistent layout files to a governed, centralized platform so the whole organization plans against one spatial source of truth instead of divergent local copies. Reduce the time to stand up new layouts or modify / re-fresh existing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate end-to-end across Manufacturing, Engineering, Supply Chain, Quality, and Facilities to ensure layouts reflect current product designs, process requirements, safety standards, and growth plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor BL or Bench engineers on layout best practices and raise the bar for spatial planning discipline across the manufacturing organization. Justify growing the team if needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or advanced degree in Industrial Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, Facilities Engineering, Architecture, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with overall facility design beyond the production floor — building shell, infrastructure integration, dock and staging design, utility routing, column grid optimization, and the interface between manufacturing layout and the physical plant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a centralized layout management capability from scratch — repository architecture, CAD standards, shape libraries, governance, and organizational adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work designing and commissioning new production lines or factories from greenfield — from process mapping through collaborating with architectural and infrastructure design partners to detailed workstation design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-mix, complex manufacturing, production ramp, or multi-site environments where layouts must accommodate frequent change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with 3D factory visualization and walkthrough tools for stakeholder review and approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Lean Manufacturing layout principles — cellular manufacturing, U-cells, one-piece flow, point-of-use storage, visual management, and 5S integration into spatial design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating layout data with enterprise systems (ERP, MES, CMMS, or facility management platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in space utilization analytics, spaghetti diagrams, and density metrics to quantify layout performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Lean Manufacturing and/or Continuous Improvement and Six Sigma principles in action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience mentoring engineers or setting technical standards for a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active security clearance, or ability to obtain and maintain a U.S. Secret security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
