&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the delivery of capability with a public sector customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow management tools such as flyte, airflow, and kubeflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with deep learning frameworks such as PyTorch&lt;/li&gt;
