&lt;p&gt;Experience deploying, debugging, and testing software on physical systems in both lab and test site environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with government reference architectures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
