&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously, take ownership of projects, and collaborate across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. TS clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in environments with complex identity or access issues, troubleshooting across distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RBAC, ABAC, or policy-as-code frameworks (e.g., OPA, Cedar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building bespoke solutions in high-growth and high-complexity environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP ecosystems and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
