&lt;li&gt;Use your knowledge and expertise of composites materials and processes (layup, cure, bonding, core, tooling), fabrication, special processes, and inspection/measurement to support the internal Anduril design process and ideation. Provide leadership to manage technical risks, proof of concepts, prototyping, and scaling designs for volume production.&lt;/li&gt;
