&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Extensive project management experience, preferably in software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Demonstrable understanding of optimization, applied probability, and AI/ML technology.&lt;/li&gt;
