&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build the deployment generator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain platform documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the bundle pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement profile-driven rendering for public cloud, enterprise on-prem, and classified air-gap targets based on profile selection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the cross-profile CI matrix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the testing and validation framework.&lt;/li&gt;
