&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;fa57f875-81e9-46db-8fcf-20c0f4e54ae7&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a5b09bd2-ee14-4274-bc48-abc3e4a16b28&quot;&gt;2+ years of research or development experience in the areas of RF and antennas (internship and thesis work acceptable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1d3b49a9-5932-4edf-94d4-6f2ea798e513&quot;&gt;1+ years of experience using one of the 3D electromagnetic (EM) simulation tools: CST, HFSS, FEKO, EMPro, TICRA or XFDTD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
