&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a573b048-8021-4c8e-ac77-0ee827afaa7c&quot;&gt;Familiarity with antenna measurement techniques and tools such as anechoic/reverb chambers, near field EM measurements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;bb4c8080-d475-4552-906f-3aa55f140b5e&quot;&gt;Familiarity with one of the mainstream RF circuit simulation tools: AWR, ADS, Genesys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;e3aa208d-e85c-40e7-90cb-bf61448a917f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with antenna prototyping tools and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
