&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in an engineering discipline, architecture, or construction management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of construction experience&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
