&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of professional experience working with industrial controls or instrumentation in a manufacturing or production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
