&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Demonstrated ability to work in a highly cross-functional role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience developing new hardware, not just incremental updates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience working through system trades, pushing back on requirements, and following through with verification and validation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Self-starter with demonstrated experience on multiple projects making hardware work within demanding time and resource constraints &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; High level of proficiency with designing signal conditioning circuits, digital circuits, and switching power converters, as demonstrated by successful fielding of multiple products &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Proficiency with schematic capture and board layout, producing clean and maintainable designs, preferably in Altium or Circuit Maker &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Knowledge of digital communications interfaces including SPI, I2C, CAN, Ethernet, and RS422 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Knowledge of common circuit blocks including filters, power supplies, and microcontrollers. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; High level of proficiency with circuit simulation tools and formal analysis methods, such as de-rating and worst-case circuit analysis &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; High level of proficiency with lab equipment for development testing of circuits and components, including sophisticated test definition, troubleshooting, data collection, and data reduction techniques &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
