&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; Bachelor’s degree in electrical engineering, computer engineering,&amp;nbsp;physics, or another STEM discipline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;1+ years of experience design/analysis of circuits, electronic products, or hardware (internships, co-ops and club teams can apply)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
