&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work extended hours and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work outdoors in all weather conditions, at heights, and in confined spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to lift up to 30 lbs unassisted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel between launch sites as required&lt;/li&gt;
