&lt;li&gt;Monitor and evaluate employee exposure to hazards during both nominal processes and emergencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop recommendations for remedial actions when safety policies are not met by employees and contractors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and provide necessary safety training to construction personnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and write corresponding reports for incidents, spills, injuries, or occupational diseases to determine root causes, establish corrective actions, and preventive measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain environmental compliance with all applicable regulations established by the EPA, RCRA, DOT, TECQ, and other applicable regulatory agencies&lt;/li&gt;
