&lt;li&gt;Construction Health and Safety Technician (CHST) certification or Certified Safety Professional (CSP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with the management of high-risk activities including steel fabrication/erection, electrical safety, excavation, confined space, fall protection, welding, material handling, rigging, and heavy equipment operations&lt;/li&gt;
