&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders, including Facilities, Civil, EHS, legal, engineering, and operations teams, to identify permitting needs and integrate them into project timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct risk assessments for permitting requirements and advise on strategies to mitigate regulatory delays or non-compliance risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor regulatory changes at federal, state, and local levels, and update internal policies and procedures accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare reports, audits, and documentation for internal reviews, regulatory submissions, and leadership briefings&lt;/li&gt;
