&lt;li&gt;Manage the capital expenditure process, including reviews, approvals, and execution of site projects to meet technical requirements, budgets, and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and commissioning of new equipment while implementing reliability programs to reduce downtime before equipment enters production&lt;/li&gt;
