&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in the design and construction of fire protection systems and/or fire protection consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in fire protection engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Engineer License (P.E.)&lt;/li&gt;
