&lt;li&gt;Professional experience developing applications using Python, C, C++, or Rust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with relational databases (SQL, PostgreSQL, MySQL, or Oracle)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
