&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in physics or an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with control systems, orbital mechanics, classical dynamics, modeling, and simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the software languages Python or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Postgraduate degree in physics or an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional experience in control systems, orbital mechanics, classical dynamics, aerodynamics, sensors and actuators, modeling and simulation, and the software languages C++ and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project or professional experience in launch vehicle and/or spacecraft system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of solving complex problems with little to no supervision on schedule as an individual or as a member of an integrated team&lt;/li&gt;
