&lt;li&gt;Ability to work weekends and night shifts as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to other launch sites in support of operational activities and launches; travel requirement is up to 15%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pass Air Force background checks for Cape Canaveral and Vandenberg&lt;/li&gt;
