&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional design and/or hands-on manufacturing experience with aerospace vehicles/payloads, automotive, aircraft, or marine assemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of prior leadership experience leading teams, projects or people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
