&lt;li&gt;Experience with PostgreSQL, SQL Server, or similar database technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience building single page web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating with ERP, accounting, or financial planning systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in testing and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial data integrity, auditability, and access controls (SOX-aware systems a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in any of the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial systems (GL, AP, AR, close, or FP&amp;amp;A)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ERP platforms (e.g. SAP, Oracle, NetSuite, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial integrations, data pipelines, or reporting platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to mentor and grow employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to collaborate across group and department lines with a wide range of engineers and managers, including networking and working in a team development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
