&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in the design and/or commissioning of mechanical engineering projects (student project team and internship experience qualifies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CAD and FEA software packages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
