&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of design and/or hands-on manufacturing experience (internships, collegiate engineering projects such as Formula SAE, Baja SAE, etc., or professional industry experience will be considered)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
