&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional travel in support of launch, test, or manufacture of hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility in working hours to support launch, test, and manufacturing cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
