&lt;p&gt;Pay range:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propulsion Engineer/Level I: $100,000.00 - $117,500.00/per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propulsion Engineer/Level II: $115,000.00 - $140,000.00/per year&lt;/li&gt;
