&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;6+ months demonstrated internship or project work in computer architecture, VLSI design, logic design, or circuit design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of formal methods or verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with C/C++, Verilog, VHDL, Python, Perl, Spice is beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
