&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical effort with lifting and carrying materials or equipment (up to 25 lbs.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possible exposure to work in extreme outdoor environments – heat, cold, rain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be available to work extended hours and weekends when needed based on site operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional travel may be required to support projects at other sites (up to 25%).&lt;/li&gt;
