&lt;li&gt;Simulate for various scenarios considering regulatory constraints, geographic constraints, RF link budgets, constellation growth, customer growth, and coordination strategies, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based on simulation results, analyze network and user experience impacts and make recommendations on satellite policy and coordination strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help provide strategic regulatory recommendations and advocacy support to business development efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
