&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, math, or science discipline OR 2+ years of experience in software development in lieu of degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software development experience in C/C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
