&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electronics, controls, motor design, and physical mechanics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in Linux, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bash shell scripting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or working with real-time embedded systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software documentation, creating system diagrams, and enumerating software requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of state machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
