&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;1+ years of experience with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Strong coding skills: clean, efficient, and well-documented code with a foundation in software design principles&lt;/li&gt;
