&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Ability to work effectively in a dynamic environment that includes working with changing needs and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Self-motivated independent learner with strong multi-tasking, organizational, communication, and documentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
