&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how material, labor, and indirect costs flow through a manufacturing or defense program lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and carry projects forward with minimal direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills — comfortable presenting financial narratives and variance explanations to non-finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with financial systems and data tools; experience with ERP platforms (Oracle preferred) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be authorized to work in the United States&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
