&lt;p&gt;As an HRIS Compliance Analyst you will lead compliance initiatives for the company’s internal HRIS: data accuracy, security, and regulatory requirements. You will review people data, prepare materials for reviews, and apply established controls so HR processes in the HRIS stay accurate. Additionally, you will handle multiple high-impact projects simultaneously in a fast-paced, rapidly changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
