&lt;li&gt;Communicate findings effectively and accurately to team members, leadership, and relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate information sharing by fostering relationships and partnering with internal stakeholders as well as external local and federal law enforcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct intelligence analysis, threat assessments, and investigations on persons, companies, and organizations of interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop risk mitigation strategies to address identified and work with internal teams to implement them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and safeguard sensitive information, including case file and intelligence reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and 2+ years of professional experience in intelligence analysis, enhanced due diligence (EDD), third party risk management (TPRM), supply chain risk management (SCRM), and/or investigations; OR 4+ years of professional experience in the aforementioned areas in lieu of a degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of all-source intelligence experience in the military, intelligence community, federal law enforcement, or in the private sector at a high-tech company and/or US Government contractor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with trade compliance regulations and restrictions, including export controls (ITAR, EAR, etc.) and import controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting trade compliance and/or supply chain teams and implementing TPRM and Denied Party Screening programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with open-source intelligence gathering tools/techniques for application/web-based social media platforms including web scraping, data parsing, and metadata extraction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing business process automation, constructing data pipelines, building dashboards, and developing robust queries and AI prompts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively communicate and collaborate with security and engineering teams on technical topics. This includes maintaining conceptual understandings of foundational topics related to data structures, databases, APIs, network infrastructure, and access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to analyze large data sets and draw actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of analytic tradecraft standards, source validation, and disinformation detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills, with the ability to produce clear and concise research reports and briefings for a wide variety of internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a team environment in a fast-paced, high-tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized with a strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to changing priorities and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of emotional intelligence and maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong critical thinking skills and a solutions-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
