&lt;li&gt;Navigate and find improvement opportunities for SpaceX&#39;s evolving banking landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an important role in building best-in-class treasury infrastructure to support global expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
