&lt;p&gt;Have experience in cybersecurity research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience with machine learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have strong software engineering skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can balance research exploration with engineering implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are passionate about AI&#39;s potential and committed to developing safe and beneficial systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
