&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience participating in or building CTF competitions and cyber ranges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Academic research experience in cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
