&lt;li&gt;Impeccable attention to detail and a proactive approach to troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; you’ll be working with senior executives and their teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of what white-glove service looks like and the attention to detail to deliver it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, roll-up-your-sleeves attitude, comfortable working independently and across teams and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
