&lt;li&gt;Experience with performance tuning and cost optimizations of cloud based data platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining a data lifecycle strategy and designing/implementing tooling for data privacy (i.e. GDPR) needs.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
